@page "/about-us"
<PageTitle>About The Singularity Workshop | Forging Software for the Singularity</PageTitle>

<div class="container py-5">
    <header class="text-center mb-5">
        <div class="mb-4">
            <img src="/images/TheSingularityWorkshopLogo.png" alt="The Singularity Workshop Logo" style="max-height: 100px; width: auto;" />
        </div>
        <h1 class="display-3 fw-bold text-primary">The Singularity Workshop</h1>
        <p class="lead text-muted fst-italic">"Forging Software for the Singularity" - Our Mission Unfolds.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="row feature-block align-items-center mb-5 p-4 rounded-3 border border-success shadow-sm bg-light">
        <div class="col-lg-12 text-center">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold text-success">Phase I: The FSM_API - Core Logic Unbound & Proven</h2>
            <p class="mb-3">
                The <strong>Finite State Machine API</strong> is our flagship, engine-agnostic logic framework, rigorously tested and integrated across diverse .NET environments, from Console and WPF applications to this very Blazor webpage. It is the stable, deterministic core designed to manage the complexity of your most ambitious applications.
            </p>
            <a href="https://www.nuget.org/packages/TheSingularityWorkshop.FSM_API" target="_blank" class="btn btn-success btn-lg me-3">
                <span class="oi oi-arrow-circle-right" aria-hidden="true"></span> Integrate FSM_API via NuGet
            </a>
            <span class="ms-3 text-muted fw-bold">Unity Asset: Coming Soon (In Submission)</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <hr class="my-5" />

    <div class="text-center mb-4">
        <h2 class="display-6 fw-bold text-info">Our Technological Pathway</h2>
        <p class="text-muted">Four distinct, interconnected technologies driving the creation of the next digital era.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="row g-4">
        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
            <div class="card h-100 bg-dark text-white shadow">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <div class="text-warning mb-2"><span class="oi oi-puzzle-piece display-6"></span></div>
                    <h5 class="card-title fw-bold text-warning">FSM Layer (Phase II)</h5>
                    <p class="card-text text-small">A vast, commercial library of state-driven systems, packaged as modular Unity assets ($15 - $75). Provides pre-built logic for jobification, serialization, design patterns, and more—a massive component toolbox for creators.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <div class="text-info mb-2"><span class="oi oi-monitor display-6"></span></div>
                    <h5 class="card-title fw-bold text-info">AnyApp / Experiences (Phase III)</h5>
                    <p class="card-text text-small">A refactoring of application development into a minimal, self-loading **AnyApp** consuming an **Experience** manifest (any sensory output). This website is evolving to become the sole distributor and controller for these modular digital creations.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
            <div class="card h-100 bg-secondary text-white shadow">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <div class="text-danger mb-2"><span class="oi oi-cloud display-6"></span></div>
                    <h5 class="card-title fw-bold text-danger">MyVR (Phase IV)</h5>
                    <p class="card-text text-small">The ultimate cloud-hosted metaverse where AnyApp experiences converge into themed domains (shopping, arts, etc.). Our unique economic model pairs digital content with in-app purchase of real-world goods and accompanying digital copies.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <div class="text-primary mb-2"><span class="oi oi-people display-6"></span></div>
                    <h5 class="card-title fw-bold text-primary">Publisher & Contact</h5>
                    <p class="card-text text-small">
                        We have found some community in <strong>Coder Legion</strong> where we proudly publish articles showcasing our technology, the problems it solves, and how to make use of it..<br />
                        **Primary Publisher Site:** <a href="https://coderlegion.com" target="_blank">coderlegion.com</a><br />
                        **Contact:** [au@coderlegion.com]
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>